<p class="sub">Pulled live from Untapped.gg. "Rare WC" and "Mythic WC" are the only numbers that limit what you can craft today. Vault Progress is a counter that, when it hits 100%, hands you 3 uncommon, 2 rare, and 1 mythic wildcard. Only duplicate commons and uncommons feed it; duplicate rares and mythics do not.</p>
