<h2 id="bans">Cards Wizards just banned (and what that means for you)</h2>
<p class="sub">When Wizards of the Coast bans a card, it can no longer be played in Standard. Several big cards were banned recently. You own four copies of each of these (a playset), which means those wildcards are now "dead", you spent them on cards you can no longer use. Nothing to do about it except note it. The good news is that the bans removed the strongest red-based aggressive decks, so the Mardu colors (white/black/red without the banned red engine) just got more space in the format. The Untapped tier list now has Mardu Discard, Orzhov Skeletons, Rakdos Fling, Boros Burn, and Boros Auras all over 55% winrate, which is why this dashboard is worth building right now.</p>
